Coverage limits (stated, not hidden)
=======================================================================
* No terminal is available in this environment, so the chip's visual styling
  and the disappearance of the old popup are proven by handle_mouse's return
  value and by source reachability, not by a rendered frame.
* The `/usage` fetch + render path after Action::ShowUsage is covered by the
  existing usage-modal tests; this round did not modify it.
* The cheatsheet guard reads the built-in registry; a registry assembled at
  runtime with user keymap overrides is not exercised.
